Package: wakeup
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: countdown alarm clock for V\OS
 WakeUp is a small countdown timer that buzzes when it reaches zero:
 set hours/minutes/seconds, start or reset, with a large digit display.
